cash requirements necessary to service interest or principal payments on our Credit Facility or senior notes; \u2022although depreciation, amortization and accretion are non-cash charges, the assets being depreciated, amortized and accreted will often have to be replaced in the future, and Adjusted EBITDA does not reflect cash requirements for such replacements; and 27\n"}
